# SOST V16.2.3 — official binary hashes
#
# Release artifact for tag v16.2.3. Only sost-cli changes; sost-node and sost-miner are
# BYTE-IDENTICAL to v16.2.0, v16.2.1 and v16.2.2 — the same two hashes every v16.2.x
# release publishes. A node or miner already on any v16.2.x does NOT restart for this
# release: replace the CLI and you are done.
#
# Why this release exists: the NODE_BIND procedure could not be followed. sost-cli had
# no --mining-key-label flag, and createnodebind always bound the key labelled
# "default", so an operator whose mining key carries any other label could not produce
# a valid bind for the #30,186 jackpot. v16.2.3 takes the label, says which mining key
# it bound, and lists the wallet's labels when the one asked for is missing.
#
# Consensus is unchanged across every v16.2.x: V16 activates at #30,000, first DTD
# Jackpot V2 #30,186.
#
# Previous lists are kept, because a rollback binary verifies against them:
#   docs/v16/SHA256SUMS_V16_2_2  docs/v16/SHA256SUMS_V16_2_1
#   docs/v16/SHA256SUMS_V16_2_0  docs/v16/SHA256SUMS_V16_1
#
# Verify:   sha256sum -c docs/v16/SHA256SUMS
#
# Build directory must be named `build`; the source path does not matter (measured
# again here: two directories, identical bytes).
